'''Brainwashed Cats''' are [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]] based on the nine [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] that you earn at the start of the game. Each Brainwashed Cat has at least one unique ability to distinguish it from its Normal, [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed]] and [[:Category:Li'l Cats|Li'l]] counterparts except for [[Brainwashed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Lizard Cat]], which does not have any abilities in its first two forms. They are all obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]], being spread across various Seasonal Gacha Events. Three select Brainwashed Cats are featured in each Seasonal Gacha Event, which are switched in each appearance of an event.

Note that while [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]], [[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Tank Cat]] and [[Brainwashed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Axe Cat]] appear to be allied versions of [[Wicked Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Cat]], [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Tank Cat]] and [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]], respectively, defeating these enemies does ''not'' unlock their Brainwashed counterparts.

The Brainwashed Cats' [[True Form]]s were all added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] and can be obtained by beating their corresponding [[:Category:Malevolent Stages|Malevolent Stages]], which appear for 1 day per month if the player has cleared [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji]] in [[The Aku Realms]]. The Malevolent Stages contain enemy versions of these True Forms known as the Malevolent Cats (e.g., [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Mohawk Cat]]'s [[Century's End (Merciless)|stage]] features a [[Malevolent Mohawk Cat]]), which are all [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] and have the [[Counter-Surge]] ability.

The list of Brainwashed Cats includes:
*[[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]] → Brainwashed Macho Cat → Brainwashed Mohawk Cat (''Complete [[Century's End (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cat]] for True Form'')
**Gains the ability to dodge Dark and Aku enemies and is faster at the cost of costing 10/15/20c more. True form increases health, now targets Relic and gains Curse Immunity.
*[[Brainwashed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Tank Cat]] → Brainwashed Wall Cat → Brainwashed Eraser Cat (''Complete [[Demon Eraser (Merciless)|The Malevolent Tank]] for True Form'')
**Is now Resistant to Traitless at the cost of costing 40/60/80c more and having a longer cooldown. True form swaps Resistant for Insanely Tough.
*[[Brainwashed Axe Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Axe Cat]] → Brainwashed Brave Cat → Brainwashed Dark Cat (''Complete [[Hyperberserker (Merciless)|The Malevolent Axe]] for True Form'')
**Is Strong Against Traitless instead of Red, has less knockbacks and can inflict curse, at the cost of less attack power. True Form gains more health and the ability to make a Lv.1 Mini-Wave.
*[[Brainwashed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Gross Cat]] → Brainwashed Sexy Legs Cat → Brainwashed Macho Legs Cat (''Complete [[Devilish Strides (Merciless)|The Malevolent Gross]] for True Form'')
**Compared to [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]], this creates a Lv.3 Surge instead of a Wave Attack, along with slightly less stats. True Form increases this to a Lv.4 Surge.
*[[Brainwashed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cow Cat]] → Brainwashed Giraffe Cat → Brainwashed Lion Cat (''Complete [[Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cow]] for True Form'') 
**Gains the ability to Curse Dark and Aku enemies. In True Form, this loses knockbacks and Curses for longer.
*[[Brainwashed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Bird Cat]] → Brainwashed UFO Cat → Brainwashed Flying Cat (''Complete [[Apocalypse (Merciless)|The Malevolent Bird]] for True Form'')
**Compared to [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Bird Cat]], this gains the ability to deal Massive Damage to Traitless enemies, Surge and Wave Immunity, and a chance to make a Lv.2 Mini-Wave at the cost of inferior stats against non-Traitless. In True Form, this gains the ability to Slow.
*[[Brainwashed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Fish Cat]] → Brainwashed Whale Cat → Brainwashed Island Cat (''Complete [[Adrift in Fear (Merciless)|The Malevolent Fish]] for True Form'')
**Compared to [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Fish Cat]], this targets Zombies instead of Red, and lacks the ability to Crit. True Form does not gain more stats but Toxic Immunity and a chance to inflict Curse.
*[[Brainwashed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Lizard Cat]] → Brainwashed Dragon Cat → Brainwashed King Dragon Cat (''Complete [[Spitting Death (Merciless)|The Malevolent Lizard]] for True Form'')
**Another copy of Lizard Cat, with differing stats from both King Dragon Cat and Crazed Lizard Cat. True Form grants Wave and Freeze Immunity and a slightly faster backswing.
*[[Brainwashed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Titan Cat]] → Brainwashed Mythic Titan → Brainwashed Jamiera Cat (''Complete [[Titanic Rampage (Merciless)|The Malevolent Titan]] for True Form'')
**Gains the ability to Savage Blow and is slightly faster. True Form gains Immunity to Knockback, Slow, Weaken, and Surge.

